From 84adf421773c295199c7e517ab07cfd6b3ee367b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sergio Gonzalez Martin <sergiog@microsoft.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 20:03:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Backport final-input recovery for JPEG scanlines

Backport zune-image PR534:
https://github.com/etemesi254/zune-image/pull/534
Upstream head: 2ace9c7facb843e92edb1251945075e346f294d4
Upstream base: fa80e24b17ff388ac850d6042bdca391f9913c4e

Apply after the twelve maintained patches without changing the crate
version or defaults. Retain the existing scaled-output variant, configured
dispatch and component-scan recovery policy.

The existing PR506/component-scan backport already avoids the two unsafe
multi-scan pixel-fill paths corrected in the reviewed upstream revision.
Preserve that behavior and include the expanded padding, row-counter,
guard-byte and retry regressions.
